GIMP Palette
Name: Tales from Space - ChatGPT Contemporary
Columns: 8
# Starter palette derived from tgstation at c16575c992d8f9adf666d7031f3f1ffc0193648a.
# The history-filtered census covers current DMI files added or changed since
# 2023-09-01. This is an authoring aid, not a claim that tg has one fixed palette.
# Keep each material on one short ramp. Use identity colours for signs, trim,
# and uniforms; use machine tints for GAGS-style overlays. LEDs may be emissive
# and unoutlined. Avoid pure RGB red: it is common in masks and debug art.
